# ring_on_block.tlspr, a block with a ring revolved three quarters of a
# turn on its side, hollowed open at the block's top, picked with the
# mouse: the ring's end on the block's side is moved out into it, its
# end in the air is a wall. The same as path_shell_ring_on_block.go
# makes (TestPathEquivalence/shell_ring_on_block).
file $testdata/ui/ring_on_block.tlspr
menu File|Open...
view default
move 360 250
down L 360 250
up L 360 250
menu Features|Shell Solid
